# Data / runtime
# Anchor data/ and external/ to the repository root: the frontend keeps source
# modules under web/frontend/src/features/graph/data/, which must stay tracked.
# log/, output/ and tmp/ stay unanchored so web/frontend/output/ keeps being ignored.
/data/
/external/
log/
output/
tmp/
update/runtime/
kemo-graph-storage/
*.log
